#. module: afa_apparel_shop
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:afa_apparel_shop.field_delivery_carrier__afa_school_pickup
msgid "School Pickup (No Address)"
msgstr "Recollida a l'escola (sense adreça)"

#. module: afa_apparel_shop
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:afa_apparel_shop.field_delivery_carrier__afa_school_pickup
msgid ""
"Orders with this delivery method are collected at the school. The checkout "
"does not require a delivery address for them."
msgstr ""
"Les comandes amb aquest mètode d'enviament es recullen a l'escola. El procés"
" de pagament no demana cap adreça d'entrega per a aquestes comandes."

#. module: afa_apparel_shop
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:afa_apparel_shop.field_sale_order__afa_stock_reserved_until
msgid "Web Stock Reserved Until"
msgstr "Estoc web reservat fins al"

#. module: afa_apparel_shop
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:afa_apparel_shop.ir_cron_send_paid_order_notifications_ir_actions_server
msgid "Notify AFA paid webshop orders"
msgstr "Notifica les comandes de la botiga web pagades de l'AFA"

#. module: afa_apparel_shop
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:afa_apparel_shop.field_res_company__afa_paid_order_email
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:afa_apparel_shop.field_res_config_settings__afa_paid_order_email
msgid "Paid Order Notification Email"
msgstr "Correu de notificació de comandes pagades"

#. module: afa_apparel_shop
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:afa_apparel_shop.field_res_company__afa_paid_order_email
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:afa_apparel_shop.field_res_config_settings__afa_paid_order_email
msgid ""
"Internal address that receives a copy of each paid webshop order so the team"
" can prepare the delivery or the school pickup. Several addresses can be "
"separated with a comma. Leave it empty to disable the notice."
msgstr ""
"Adreça interna que rep una còpia de cada comanda de la botiga web ja pagada"
" perquè l'equip pugui preparar l'entrega o la recollida a l'escola. Es poden"
" posar vàries adreces separades per comes. Deixa-ho buit per desactivar "
"l'avís."

#. module: afa_apparel_shop
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:afa_apparel_shop.field_sale_order__afa_paid_order_email_sent
msgid "Paid Order Email Sent"
msgstr "Correu de comanda pagada enviat"

#. module: afa_apparel_shop
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:afa_apparel_shop.field_sale_order__afa_paid_order_email_sent
msgid ""
"The internal notice used to prepare the delivery has been sent for this "
"order."
msgstr "L'avís intern per preparar l'entrega ja s'ha enviat per a aquesta comanda."

#. module: afa_apparel_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:afa_apparel_shop.view_res_config_settings_afa_apparel
msgid "Order Notifications"
msgstr "Notificacions de comandes"

#. module: afa_apparel_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:afa_apparel_shop.view_res_config_settings_afa_apparel
msgid "Paid order email"
msgstr "Correu de comanda pagada"

#. module: afa_apparel_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:afa_apparel_shop.view_res_config_settings_afa_apparel
msgid ""
"Internal address that receives each paid webshop order so the team can "
"prepare the delivery. Leave empty to disable."
msgstr ""
"Adreça interna que rep cada comanda de la botiga web pagada perquè l'equip "
"pugui preparar-ne l'entrega. Deixa-ho buit per desactivar l'avís."
